OL,3,GNEWSABeach ordnance destroyed in
OL,4,Acontrolled explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo pieces of suspected ordnance found
OL,7,Fon a Kent beach were destroyed in a
OL,8,Fcontrolled explosion.
OL,10,FHM Coastguard said the items were
OL,11,Freported at Sandwich Bay at about 19:50
OL,12,FBST on Sunday.
OL,14,FAn Explosive Ordnance Disposal Team
OL,15,Fdestroyed the objects at about 11:15 on
OL,16,FMonday, supported by Deal Coastguard
OL,17,FRescue Team.
OL,19,FThe Coastguard said the suspected
OL,20,Fordnance was "safely disposed of in a
OL,21,Fcontrolled explosion" following the
OL,22,Freport.
